<title>GERMANY: Schering sees single-digit pct profit growth in 97.</title>
<headline>Schering sees single-digit pct profit growth in 97.</headline>
<dateline>BERLIN 1996-11-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>German pharmaceuticals group Schering AG said on Monday it expected earnings growth to slow down in 1997 to a single-digit percentage rise after an expected 34 percent net profit rise in 1996.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
